['2026 candidate results/turnout','Detailed results report10; voters report12; electors report11','ECI 2026 Tamil Nadu statistical reports'],
['2021 results/turnout','Detailed results report10; constituency summaries report8','ECI original XLSX; archived official PDF cross-check'],
['Urban context','Village-panchayat/AC crosswalk; Census2011 parent-district urban population','TNRD and Tamil Nadu DES'],
['Geographic polygons','234 AC IDs, 2021 boundaries; approximate area and locations','Baskicanvas/DataMeet derivative, third-party'],
